1 line: SystemVerilog literals that hold a slash pair.
3 trailing line: all zeros
4 trailing line: fill literals
5 trailing line: an assignment pattern
6 trailing line: a cast, then a division
8 trailing line: a named assignment pattern
11 trailing line: after the triple-quoted string
13 trailing line: after the escaped triple quote
14 trailing line: after an empty string
15 trailing line: after an escaped backslash
17 trailing line: after an angle-bracket include
18 trailing line: display
19 trailing line: a named block
21 line: a comment with a closing */ in it
22 trailing line: power and division
23 trailing line: a cycle delay
24 trailing line: an iff qualifier
